rnment  Myanmar's democratic transition has  opened the door to foreign investment  there plans to develop the area in and  around the park including two hydropower  dam projects on the Souren River in the  current struggle to protect their  community and their way of life  they'll have to be prepared to take on  corporations to Florence lui al Jazeera  Yangon
 

